config: sensors polled every 2500 us; bridge every 5000 us; run 20000 us
sample t=2000 us (accel gen 3): accel_driver +50 sensors +950 estimator +200 dds_bridge +2100 ros2_listener +150  -> age at listener 3450 us
sample t=7000 us (accel gen 8): accel_driver +50 sensors +950 estimator +200 dds_bridge +2100 ros2_listener +150  -> age at listener 3450 us
sample t=12000 us (accel gen 13): accel_driver +50 sensors +950 estimator +200 dds_bridge +2100 ros2_listener +150  -> age at listener 3450 us
latency added per hop (min..max over delivered samples):
  accel_driver: 50..50 us
  sensors: 950..950 us
  estimator: 200..200 us
  dds_bridge: 2100..2100 us
  ros2_listener: 150..150 us
age of the sample when the estimator finished: 700..1200 us
accel samples published: 20; used by the estimator: 8; overwritten before sensors read them: 10
estimator outputs not forwarded (the bridge runs slower on purpose): 3
